DECLARE `o 67 r 2(1) kind of application` IS ONE OF
    `o 67 r 2(1)(a) an application for a warrant for search and seizure under section 11(1)(a)`
    `o 67 r 2(1)(b) an application for a restraint order under section 11(1)(b)`
    `o 67 r 2(1) another application`

