      `the affidavit states the grounds for believing that the property has been or will be used, in whole or in part, to facilitate or carry out a terrorist act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the affidavit states the full particulars of the property and specifies the person or persons in possession` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the affidavit states whether a warrant for search and seizure or restraint order has been issued under section 11(1) in relation to the property` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 67 r 8(2) the application is filed and served with the affidavit the Rule requires` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the application is for an order of forfeiture under section 21`)
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The application" is the one in paragraph (1)
    ELSE IF    `the application is filed and served with a supporting affidavit`
